# 性質と、それを調べる構成（viewer-single: showIntake が intake を 1 回送る、viewer-resume: showIntake が intake を 2 回続けて送る）
InvViewersMatchRetained viewer-single viewer-resume
InvEndFramesAfterClose viewer-single viewer-resume
InvSendsSerializedPerKind viewer-resume
InvNoSendAfterEnd viewer-resume
